(
    title: "Cosmic Ark",
    developer: Some("Rob Fulop"),
    description: Some("Imagic\'s follow-on from Atlantis alternates two duties: hold off meteor showers streaking in from all four sides, then drop a shuttle to hostile planets and tractor-beam specimens aboard, with one 40-unit fuel reserve standing in for lives — spent by damage and gunfire, refilled by clean shooting and captures. Its shimmering starfield famously rides a TIA hardware bug, and a second cartridge revision let players toggle the effect with the TV Type switch."),
